{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/b2df3722d69f0b4549301e5d77518495.avif?t=1753227921\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude78 Step inside the ward - join us on Discord:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\ude78 <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ashes of the Damned - Chapter 1: The Forgotten Ward</strong> <br><i>The first chapter in a four-part standalone psychological horror anthology.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/ded76ea7a47f2478f0001eb9f4ec51f2.poster.avif?t=1753227921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/ded76ea7a47f2478f0001eb9f4ec51f2.webm?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken in a rotting asylum.<br>No direction. No answers. Just walls that hum and shadows that stretch too long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Something is watching.<br>And it remembers you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This place remembers you.<br>But you don\u2019t remember it.<br>Not yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>What You\u2019ll Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person psychological horror experience with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploration-driven gameplay in a looping, handcrafted asylum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fear-based entity that evolves as you uncover more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flashlight mechanics where light is both lifeline\u2026 and liability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 patient profiles. Each one pulling you deeper into who you were\u2026 and what you did</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enemy you can't fight.<br><strong>It can\u2019t see you. But it knows you\u2019re here.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal UI. No guidance. No help. Only what you choose to uncover</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/2131c50631b3d3296f765bcf24bfe168.poster.avif?t=1753227921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/2131c50631b3d3296f765bcf24bfe168.webm?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/2131c50631b3d3296f765bcf24bfe168.mp4?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ward doesn\u2019t change.<br>But something in it does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every file you find distorts the feeling of the space - subtly.  <br>Light flickers. <br>Paths feel less certain. <br>Whispers twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And always, the thing hunting you grows closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/90bb52841bdd4e11848b61b6c0212859.poster.avif?t=1753227921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/90bb52841bdd4e11848b61b6c0212859.webm?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/90bb52841bdd4e11848b61b6c0212859.mp4?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some truths were meant to be buried.<br>Some sins were never yours to dig up.<br>But you keep going - deeper into the walls\u2026 and into yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/0d7c5ef633194d38ee6098a40859911a.poster.avif?t=1753227921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/0d7c5ef633194d38ee6098a40859911a.webm?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/0d7c5ef633194d38ee6098a40859911a.mp4?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You won\u2019t find checkpoints.<br>You won\u2019t find forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll find a door that wasn\u2019t there before.<br>And behind it - something that feels like a memory. <br>Or a warning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>The Anthology</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ashes of the Damned</strong> is a four-part standalone horror anthology.<br>Each chapter is its own descent into guilt, silence, and the things we hide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter pulls something out of you.<br>And asks what\u2019s left when it\u2019s done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chapter 1: The Forgotten Ward</strong> is just the beginning.<br>But the ward\u2026 was always waiting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/cabc01f9ad8dcf77329bfa83a412b191.poster.avif?t=1753227921\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/cabc01f9ad8dcf77329bfa83a412b191.webm?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/cabc01f9ad8dcf77329bfa83a412b191.mp4?t=1753227921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Forgotten Ward doesn\u2019t want you here\u2026</strong><br><strong>But it remembers you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A first-person psychological horror experience with no combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Narrative-driven exploration in a looping, handcrafted asylum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique fear-based entity that evolves as you uncover more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flashlight mechanics where visibility and vulnerability are one and the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 patient profiles to discover, each unlocking a deeper layer of memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal UI, immersive audio, and no handholding \u2014 only what you\u2019re willing to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A standalone chapter in a four-part anthology of psychological horror</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>For Players Who Liked:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you were drawn to the emotional dread and mystery of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Silent Hill 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Amnesia: The Dark Descent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Returnal</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stories Untold</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Outlast</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Martha Is Dead</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...then <strong>Ashes of the Damned - Chapter 1</strong> was made to follow you home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843760?t=1753227921","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/